  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Blas">Blas.</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he þone að forðbringan ne mæg and he þonne fúl sy, stande on þæra yldesta manna dome, hweðer he lif áge þe nage, þe to þære byrig hyran.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he [the accused] cannot produce the oath and is proved guilty, the chief men of the borough shall decide whether his life shall be spared or not.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If he cannot produce the oath and so be guilty, let it be in the judgement of the most senior men that belong to the borough whether he have life or not.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf he ðonne að forðbringan ne mæge 7 he ðonne ful sy, stonde on ðara yldestana manna dome, hwæðer he hlif age ðe náge, þe to ðære byrig hyron.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
